        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana ZDR, Elite Collection Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Low Profile Modern Deadbolt is a single cylinder deadbolt meaning there is a keyed lock on the exterior and a thumb-turn on the interior. It has a contemporary feel that most round style deadbolts do not achieve. This front door lock will look great on modern homes and it is really easy to install--perfect for a first DIY project. It has an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch through 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, oil-rubbed bronze, or polished brass finishes\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by thumb-turn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZDR-specifications.gif?v=1704354534\" width=\"487\" height=\"159\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana ZDR Specifcations\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the DoralLock Elite Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 Security</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway compatible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Modern Round Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb-Turn Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZDR-spcifications.pdf?v=1704262321\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana ZDR Round Elite Single Cylinder Deadbolt (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Low Profile Modern Deadbolt, Deltana ZDR",
                "description": "Deltana ZDR, Low Profile Modern Deadbolt - The Low Profile Modern Deadbolt is a single cylinder deadbolt meaning there is a keyed lock on the exterior and a thumb-turn on the interior. It has a contemporary feel that most round style deadbolts do not achieve. This front door lock will look great on modern homes and it is really easy to install--perfect for a first DIY project. It has an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/8 inch through 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, oil-rubbed bronze, or polished brass finishes",
